    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a fascinating subject for me, blending logic with creativity. I appreciate its precision but also enjoy the problem-solving aspect. It's not just about numbers; it's about patterns and structures that make sense of the world. My master's degree in philosophy even made me see math as a language—one that describes relationships and truths.",
